diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index c0f5363..1c5cd26 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fix: a posting of zero was accepted and written to the journal; it is now refused, and a journal holding one fails to load at that line.
 - Transaction and statement dates are `datetime.date` values; dates may be given as `datetime.date` or `YYYY-MM-DD` text.
 - Statements take an optional start and end date (`--from`/`--to` on the command line) and open with the balance carried in from before the start.
 - Journal files write posting amounts as decimal text in the journal currency (format version 2); version 1 journals still load.
diff --git a/docs/reference.md b/docs/reference.md
index b89519e..f9c5fcc 100644
--- a/docs/reference.md
+++ b/docs/reference.md
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@ table lists one documented fact per row: its key, its value, and what it means.
 | `error.too_few_postings` | `transaction needs at least 2 postings` | `LedgerError` |
 | `error.too_many_postings` | `transaction has more than 16 postings` | `LedgerError` |
 | `error.posting_type` | `posting amount must be an integer: {amount!r}` | `LedgerError` for a float, bool or text amount |
+| `error.zero_amount` | `posting amount must not be zero: {account}` | `LedgerError` naming the first posting whose amount is zero |
 | `error.unbalanced` | `transaction does not balance: off by {difference}` | `UnbalancedError`; the difference is in minor units |
 | `reversal.description` | `Reversal: {description}` | Default description of `reversal()`, cut to 120 characters |
 
